[gd_scene load_steps=4 format=3 uid="uid://unitdecalnormalmap"]

; One variable: `texture_normal` on a decal whose albedo is the grey of the floor. Godot mixes the
; map's normal into the receiver's by the decal's alpha, so the footprint shows bumps in the light
; and the grey stays the floor's. `unit-decal` and the other decal scenes carry an albedo alone,
; so none of them shows a normal map.

